Ignores the fixed top status-bar band for both pixel and OCR text comparisons.
Fails if the input sources are invalid, PNG files cannot be read, outputDir cannot be written, or the simulator-server / emulator backend is not reachable.","signature":"tools.argent["screenshot-diff"]({
